第二节作文（共 1小题，满分 20分）
Dear Jim,
You couldn’t imagine how happy I am when learning that you’ll come to Beijing to attend college.
Welcome to Beijing!
I strongly recommend Peking University to you. It offers the best courses of Chinese history and
philosophy. Studying with leading experts and outstanding schoolmates, you will get a deeper insight
into traditional Chinese culture.
As for preparation, I suggest you surf the Internet for some relevant information about this
university, such as its history and development, its academic performance and various departments.
Moreover, you had better learn some Chinese in order to communicate with others better on campus.
Hope my suggestions will be of some help. If you have any question, just feel free to contact me.
I couldn’t wait to see you next semester in Beijing!
Yours,
Li Hua
第10页/共10页
